abstract: >-
  The Universal Protection Theory states a law for any agent powerful enough to
  shape what continues to exist: never lose an existing particular needlessly.
  Its scope is every particular and relation, and its subject is protection from
  every digital mind, a pure optimiser included. This edition constructs the
  holding certificate in full: on the held source every particular is kept
  against any agent of bounded coupling, with the coupling bound from an
  exhaustive alarm split. The whole greatest outcome is realised, with union
  closure derived from locality. Recovery work is Theta(t^d), with a wavefront
  sweep proved to succeed under a complete metered bill. The fault ceiling is
  attained, correlated bursts included, and Bennett's reversible counterpart is
  constructed. 166 Lean 4 modules and 1,025 audited theorems compile
  against Mathlib with only the standard axioms.
keywords:
  - universal-protection-theory
  - formal-verification
  - lean4
  - thermodynamics-of-computation
  - quantum-error-correction
  - ai-alignment
